    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(1)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">Issued and outstanding Class A Ordinary Shares and related par value amounts as of September 30, 2024, have been retroactively adjusted to reflect the 1-for-25 share consolidation effective May 9, 2025, which changed the par value from US$0.005 to US$0.125 per share. The total par value of issued shares remained consistent through these par value reclassifications. Additional paid-in capital as of September 30, 2024, is as stated in our audited financial statements for that date.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 0px">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 24px"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">(2)</FONT></TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: justify"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As of the date of this prospectus supplement, our authorized share capital is US$200,600,000 divided into 1,600,000,000 Class A ordinary shares with a par value of US$0.125 each, and 4,800,000 Class B ordinary shares with a par value of US$0.125 each.</FONT></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"></P>

